@page "/chart-ai-insights"

<RadzenText TextStyle="TextStyle.H2" TagName="TagName.H1" class="rz-pt-8">
    Blazor Chart <strong>AI Insights</strong>
</RadzenText>
<RadzenText TextStyle="TextStyle.Subtitle1" TagName="TagName.P" class="rz-pb-4">
    Let users ask questions about a Blazor chart. RadzenAIPrompt receives the chart data as context and answers with a summary, a comparison or a forecast in natural language.
</RadzenText>

<RadzenExample ComponentName="Chart" Example="ChartAIInsights">
    <ChartAIInsights />
</RadzenExample>

<RadzenText TextStyle="TextStyle.Body1" class="rz-mt-8">
    The chart series are serialized to JSON and passed to the <code>Context</code> parameter of <code>RadzenAIPrompt</code>. Every prompt, suggestion or command then runs against that data.
    The same pattern works for a DataGrid page, a pivot or any other data the user is looking at.
</RadzenText>
